Idea:
Every substring can be generated using two loops.
First loop selects starting index.
Second loop selects ending index.
Store each substring in a set to automatically remove duplicates.
Return the size of the set.

Steps:
Create a set to store substrings.
Run loop from i = 0 to n-1
Run inner loop from j = i to n-1
Keep adding characters to form substring.
Insert substring into set.
Return set size.
